{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05451","headline":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边 · 袁晖","name":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出师宣九命，分阃用三台。\n始应幕中画，言从天上来。\n丹青不独任，韬略遂双该。\n坐见威棱洽，弥彰事业恢。\n旌旗晓云送，鞞鼓朔风催。\n虏气消残月，边声韵落梅。\n羽书雄北地，龙漠寝南垓。\n宠战黄金尽，输诚白日回。\n离章宸翰发，祖讌国门开。\n欲识恩华盛，平生文武材。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁晖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}